<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>LeadRelay | Turn website visitors into qualified WhatsApp leads</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-1: #081125;
            --bg-2: #111a34;
            --bg-3: #1c2749;
            --ink: #eef2ff;
            --muted: #b9c3de;
            --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
            --panel: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            --brand: #3ce2a3;
            --brand-strong: #13bf83;
            --accent: #ffbe4f;
            --danger: #ff7f7f;
            --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        html, body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            min-height: 100%;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Outfit", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background:
                radial-gradient(1000px 500px at -10% -20%, rgba(60, 226, 163, 0.2), transparent 65%),
                radial-gradient(900px 450px at 110% -10%, rgba(255, 190, 79, 0.2), transparent 70%),
                linear-gradient(165deg, var(--bg-1), var(--bg-2) 40%, var(--bg-3));
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .back-grid {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: -2;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 36px 36px;
            mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, black 35%, transparent 90%);
        }

        .orb {
            position: fixed;
            width: 520px;
            height: 520px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            filter: blur(80px);
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.45;
            pointer-events: none;
            animation: float 14s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .orb-a {
            top: -180px;
            left: -120px;
            background: #2ee59f;
        }

        .orb-b {
            right: -160px;
            top: 30%;
            background: #ffbe4f;
            animation-delay: -5s;
        }

        @@keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) translateX(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(24px) translateX(-18px); }
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .wrap {
            width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 18px 0 64px;
        }

        .topbar {
            position: sticky;
            top: 12px;
            z-index: 10;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            background: rgba(9, 14, 31, 0.72);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.2px;
        }

        .logo {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: #042115;
            font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2ee59f, #8cf8d0);
        }

        .nav {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 14px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.94rem;
        }

        .nav a:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .hero {
            margin-top: 44px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.9fr;
            gap: 22px;
            align-items: stretch;
        }

        .hero-main,
        .hero-side,
        .section-panel {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 26px;
            background: var(--panel);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .hero-main {
            padding: 32px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-main::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            right: -80px;
            top: -80px;
            width: 240px;
            height: 240px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(60,226,163,0.38), transparent 70%);
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 7px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(60, 226, 163, 0.45);
            background: rgba(60, 226, 163, 0.12);
            color: #9ffad8;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-family: "Space Grotesk", "Outfit", sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.4rem);
            line-height: 1.03;
            margin: 16px 0 14px;
            max-width: 14ch;
        }

        .hero p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            max-width: 56ch;
        }

        .cta-row {
            margin-top: 22px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 11px;
        }

        .btn {
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 11px 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: transform 0.12s ease, filter 0.12s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            filter: brightness(1.06);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            color: #032417;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), #8cf8d0);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            color: var(--ink);
            border-color: var(--line);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        }

        .hero-side {
            padding: 22px;
            display: grid;
            gap: 14px;
            align-content: start;
        }

        .metric-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .metric {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 12px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        }

        .metric strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .metric span {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.83rem;
        }

        .chat-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 14px;
            background: rgba(3, 8, 19, 0.45);
            display: grid;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .bubble {
            max-width: 86%;
            padding: 9px 11px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.36;
        }

        .bubble.me {
            margin-left: auto;
            color: #062919;
            background: #9ffad8;
        }

        .bubble.bot {
            color: #e4ebff;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
        }

        .section {
            margin-top: 22px;
            display: grid;
            gap: 22px;
        }

        .section-panel {
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .section-title {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.55rem;
        }

        .section-sub {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .cards {
            margin-top: 14px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .card {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 14px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin: 8px 0 6px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .icon-pill {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(60, 226, 163, 0.42);
            background: rgba(60, 226, 163, 0.14);
            color: #8df7d1;
        }

        .split {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        .list {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            list-style: none;
            display: grid;
            gap: 9px;
        }

        .list li {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.93rem;
        }

        .list i {
            color: var(--brand);
            margin-top: 1px;
            flex: 0 0 auto;
        }

        .cta-band {
            margin-top: 18px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,190,79,0.45);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,190,79,0.22), rgba(255,190,79,0.08));
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 28px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
            padding-top: 14px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px 14px;
            justify-content: space-between;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        footer a:hover { color: #fff; }

        @@media (max-width: 960px) {
            .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        @@media (max-width: 620px) {
            .wrap { width: calc(100% - 24px); }
            .topbar { position: static; }
            .hero-main,
            .hero-side,
            .section-panel { border-radius: 20px; }
            .hero-main { padding: 22px; }
            .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .metric-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="back-grid"></div>
<div class="orb orb-a"></div>
<div class="orb orb-b"></div>

<div class="wrap">
    <header class="topbar">
        <div class="brand">
            <span class="logo">LR</span>
            <span>LeadRelay</span>
        </div>
        <nav class="nav">
            <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
            <a href="#for-owners">For business owners</a>
            <a href="/owner/login">Owner login</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <article class="hero-main">
            <span class="tag"><i data-lucide="sparkles" style="width:14px;height:14px;"></i> Lead capture on autopilot</span>
            <h1>Turn website chats into qualified WhatsApp leads.</h1>
            <p>LeadRelay helps small business owners capture better enquiries, ask the right questions, and follow up while intent is still high. No heavy CRM setup. No missed conversations.</p>
            <div class="cta-row">
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#how-it-works"><i data-lucide="rocket" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i> See how it works</a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/owner/login"><i data-lucide="log-in" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i> Open owner portal</a>
            </div>
        </article>

        <aside class="hero-side">
            <div class="metric-grid">
                <div class="metric">
                    <strong>1 script</strong>
                    <span>Drop into your site</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <strong>24/7</strong>
                    <span>Always-on capture</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <strong>Per-site</strong>
                    <span>Custom question flow</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <strong>WhatsApp</strong>
                    <span>Native follow-up</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="chat-card">
                <div class="bubble me">Hi, I run an interior design business and need more leads.</div>
                <div class="bubble bot">Great. What type of projects do you usually take on, and where do you operate?</div>
                <div class="bubble me">Mostly kitchen and living spaces in Bristol.</div>
                <div class="bubble bot">Perfect. What's the best way and time to contact you?</div>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="how-it-works">
        <article class="section-panel">
            <h2 class="section-title">How it works</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">A straightforward flow focused on lead quality and speed to first response.</p>
            <div class="cards">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon-pill"><i data-lucide="code" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></div>
                    <h3>Add the widget</h3>
                    <p>Embed one script and your WhatsApp chat entry point appears instantly.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon-pill"><i data-lucide="messages-square" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></div>
                    <h3>Ask smart questions</h3>
                    <p>Capture business context and contact preferences, not random back-and-forth.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon-pill"><i data-lucide="send" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></div>
                    <h3>Follow up fast</h3>
                    <p>Open a lead and reply directly from the owner workspace in seconds.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="section-panel" id="for-owners">
            <h2 class="section-title">Built for owner-led service businesses</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">Ideal for interior designers, consultants, agencies, and local service teams that need a practical lead workflow.</p>
            <div class="split">
                <div>
                    <ul class="list">
                        <li><i data-lucide="check-circle-2" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i><span>Qualify by business type, services, and service area</span></li>
                        <li><i data-lucide="check-circle-2" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i><span>Capture best contact method and preferred contact time</span></li>
                        <li><i data-lucide="check-circle-2" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i><span>Keep lead data scoped to each tenant/site</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <ul class="list">
                        <li><i data-lucide="shield-check" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i><span>Domain allow-list to control where widget loads</span></li>
                        <li><i data-lucide="gauge" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i><span>Clean owner inbox with quick reply workflow</span></li>
                        <li><i data-lucide="settings-2" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i><span>Customizable fields per site without code changes</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="cta-band">
                <div>
                    <strong>Ready to test the live widget?</strong><br />
                    <span style="color:#fde4b7;">Use the WhatsApp button on this page to run the full flow now.</span>
                </div>
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#how-it-works"><i data-lucide="play" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i> Start test flow</a>
            </div>
        </article>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <span>LeadRelay for small business teams.</span>
        <span>
            <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a> ·
            <a href="/terms-and-conditions">Terms and conditions</a> ·
            <a href="/user-data-deletion">User data deletion</a>
        </span>
        <span>Contact: hello@leadrelay.dev</span>
    </footer>
</div>

<script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
<script>
    if (window.lucide) {
        window.lucide.createIcons();
    }
</script>

<script src="/widget/bootstrap.js?siteId=42bf2d82-3f8c-421f-a520-f32f029d8099"></script>
</body>
</html>
